{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q9azs2luWj2rkYqWlRuRSU","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"7:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"5868\">\n    <frame id=\"7:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"7:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"7:5\" name=\"FASCO — fashion store website\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"7:6\" name=\"Design a fashion e-commerce website: land on the home page, browse the shop, open a product, add it to the cart, review the cart, check out, and sign up, sign in or recover an account. Desktop web, 1920 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"7:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 11 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the two typefaces in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, the avatars, the sign-in logos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"3285\">\n      <text id=\"7:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"3196\">\n        <frame id=\"7:14\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"796\">\n          <text id=\"7:15\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"82\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:16\" name=\"Goal: Discover deals, new arrivals and the brand.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:18\" name=\"• Brands: Minimog · Retrolie · Brook · Learts · Vagabond (as wordmarks) • Collection banner: Photo_Collection with item labels “Flat Cap” · “Cotton Shirt” · “Suspender” · “Leather Shoes” · “Men Collection” · “Classic Gentleman” · “DESCRIPTION” · copy (see DATA) · “Size:” M · $100.00 · “Buy Now” • Deals Of The Month: “Deals Of The Month” · copy (see DATA) · “Buy Now” · “Hurry, Before It’s Too Late!” · countdown 02 Days · 06 Hr · 05 Mins · 30 Sec · deal slides Photo_Deal_1, Photo_Deal_2, Photo_Deal_3 · current slide card “01 — Spring Sale” · “30% OFF” · previous / next (Icon_Chevron_Left, Icon_Chevron_Right) · slide indicator: 4 slides, current 1 • Features: High Qualit