ight=\"836\">\n          <text id=\"7:29\" name=\"03_Product\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:30\" name=\"Goal: Choose size and color for the Denim Jacket and add it to the cart.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:32\" name=\"• Actions: Compare (Icon_Compare) · Ask a question (Icon_Question) · Share (Icon_Share) • Collection banner: Photo_Collection with item labels “Flat Cap” · “Cotton Shirt” · “Suspender” · “Leather Shoes” · “Men Collection” · “Classic Gentleman” · “DESCRIPTION” · copy (see DATA) · “Size:” M · $100.00 · “Buy Now” • Delivery: “Estimated Delivery:” Jul 30 - Aug 03 (Icon_Delivery) · “Free Shipping &amp; Returns:” On all orders over $75 (Icon_Returns) · “Guarantee safe &amp; secure checkout” • Features: High Quality · Warranty Protection · Free Shipping · 24 / 7 Support, each with icon and line (see DATA) • Footer: “FASCO” · Home · Shop · Products · Pages · “Copyright © 2022 FASCO. All Rights Reserved.” • Gallery: Photo_Denim_Jacket_Blue_2 (main) · thumbnails Photo_Denim_Jacket_Lilac, Photo_Denim_Jacket_Blue_1, Photo_Denim_Jacket_Blue_2, Photo_Denim_Jacket_Blue_3, Photo_Denim_Jacket_Black_1, Photo_Denim_Jacket_Black_2 • Header: “FASCO” wordmark · navigation Home / Shop / Products / Pages · current: Products · search (Icon_Search) · account (Icon_Account) · wishlist (Icon_Star) · cart (Icon_Cart) • Newsletter: “Subscribe To Our Newsletter” · copy (see DATA) · email field “michael@example.com” · “Subscribe Now” · Photo_Subscribe_Left · Photo_Subscribe_Right • Options: “Size: M” · M · L · XL · XXL · selected: M · “Color: Blue” · Blue · Black · Lilac · selected: Blue • People Also Loved: “People Also Loved” · copy (see DATA) · “Buy Now” · “Hurry, Before It’s Too Late!” · countdown 02 Days · 06 Hr · 05 Mins · 30 Sec · deal slides Photo_Deal_1, Photo_Deal_2, Photo_Deal_3 · curren