{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNg32pHZOmaJuFovr9xb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a review pass on the 02_Shop screen. The brief requires the Collection banner, Features, Instagram, Newsletter, Footer, Header, Page title, Pagination, Products, Toolbar and Filters, so the Collection banner and Features strip must be added. The Sold Out badge is not visible on the Linen-blend Shirt card at 1010,460, and the Oversized T-shirt shows no old price, because overrides on hidden master children do not apply.\n\nI fix this by making the master's Old Price and Sold Out Badge visible, then setting their text per card, using empty text where no old price is needed, and placing the Sold Out overlay directly on the shirt instance.\n\nThe cards are 300 wide with a 30 gap, starting at x=680, ending at 1640, past the 1620 right edge. A 300*3+2*20=940 grid fits exactly. The 1320-wide toolbar at x=680 overflows to 2000, so I build a 940-wide toolbar instead, with the sort box at 710 and grid icons at 870 and 910.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":117370,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":117370}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"45b716de-dcc2-45d2-a4d3-f5e780ce57d2","uuid":"65b053a9-462d-424d-a5e5-e79de9ad5d9d","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:14:26.289Z","thinking_duration_ms":18143}
